# Corpus, catalogue and result trees.
#
# This repository holds the code and the written account of the work: the notebooks with their
# outputs intact, a README per chapter, and the scripts behind each reported figure. It does not
# distribute the corpus scans, the crop store, the DINOv2 embeddings, the fleuron catalogue, the
# trained detector weights, or the frozen result trees those stages wrote.
#
# Nothing reported is lost by their absence. Every notebook is stored executed, so each table,
# figure and printed result is readable here exactly as it was produced. The scripts under
# _tools/ are included because the code behind a reported artifact belongs with the account of
# it, but most of them read a result tree and so are reference rather than runnable.
Images/
images suppl/
*.pt
